  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the Tools and tool libraries guide. Link it from the guide index, first run, glossary and CLI page.\nCover tool creation, holders, modular bodies, import modes, export, numbering and refusals.\nUpdate operation, setup, machine, posting, MCP and refusal pages from the shipped code.\nReview all 57 PRs merged after v0.20.0 through base b27d1da7.\nThe issue comment records a page or a no-doc reason for each PR.\nRecord the decisions in `docs/decisions/1792-guide-review.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe guide has no tools reference. Some pages omit shipped controls and still say that wire EDM cannot post.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `test_tools_guide_covers_library_workflow`: red before the fix, green after it.\n- `test_tools_guide_is_linked_from_entry_pages`: red before the fix, green after it.\n- Run these temporary content pins from `/tmp/1792-pin.py`. They are not part of the branch.\n- Remove the new tools page: red. Restore it: green.\n- Copy each original entry page from `git show upstream/main:<path>`: red for each page. Restore each edited page: green.\n- `zola build` with Zola 0.23.6: green. It renders 43 pages with no broken internal links.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green. No Rust crates change, so the gate selects no Rust steps.\n- Clippy does not apply because no crate changes.\n- `git diff --check`: green. Read every diff hunk and record its reason outside the branch.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo hardware runs, GUI sessions or screenshots. Check instructions against CamCraft source, tests and merged PR descriptions.\nThe pin checks tool-page coverage and entry links. It does not check every sentence for technical accuracy.\nNo recurring release process rule changes. The issue leaves that decision to the maintainer.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. Check each changed path against open PR files before editing it.\n\nEffort: medium. No escalation.\n\nChangelog: none (documentation only)\n\nFixes #1792\n",
